    active theme by applying theme in TermPane::createTerminal().
  * Fix invisible splitter handles and sidebar section borders caused by
    DTK palette integration overriding default style colors.
  * Disable DTK built-in switch-theme menu to avoid duplication with the
    new Theme submenu.

